  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "中英文導覽實務",
    "sub_ename": "CHINESE AND ENGLISH TOUR-GUIDING PRACTICE",
    "describe_ch": "本課程旨在培養學生中英文導覽解說能力，配合不同主題及情境模擬學習，讓學生熟悉觀光遊憩區生態及文化資源。內容包含著名景點、博物館、美術館、文物古蹟、科技產品等。透過課堂講解、實地/線上參訪與演練，訓練學生良好儀態，並增進其中英文導覽解說及應對溝通技能。",
    "describe_eh": "This course is designed to cultivate students’ competence of Chinese and English tour-guiding and interpreting. Students will be acquainted with the ecological and cultural resources of tourism and recreational areas through exercises of diverse themes with a simulated situation learning approach. The contents include famous tourist attractions, museums, cultural relics and historic sites, and technological products. Moreover, students will improve their manners, postures, and tour-guiding and communicative skills through lectures, site/online visits and in-class practice.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 2.0
  },
